00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.795
The systems gate asks: can you repeat last week without chaos?

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:05.866
This lesson is about systems gate.

00:00:05.866 --> 00:00:07.591
Can you repeat last week?

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:07.936
.

00:00:07.936 --> 00:00:10.351
