00:00:10.351 --> 00:00:13.802
Treat it as a move you can run this week.

00:00:13.802 --> 00:00:18.977
By the end, you should be able to act without waiting for a perfect plan.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:22.773
Keep the DigProg habit: watch, practice, then take one real action.

00:00:22.773 --> 00:00:26.568
Stay practical: pass systems self-check before you optimize branding or tools.

00:00:26.888 --> 00:00:30.650
Self-check: scoreboard, calendar blocks, delivery checklist, FAQ, stop rule.

00:00:30.650 --> 00:00:33.158
Remember the objective: pass systems self-check.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:37.756
